  unitName: Genome Child Cosette (EU)
  unitId: 760264
  unitNumber: 7222
  description: A young girl with a tragic past. Years ago, Cornelius and his henchmen
    attacked several villages, one of which was the village of a future politician.
    The seafaring Shapeshifter had also crossed the path of an orphan. As he was
    about to kill her, she showed her Shapeshifter power. A special power that impressed
    Cornelius. He decided to spare Cosette, but with a specific purpose in mind.
    Because of his strategic position offshore, he could afford to be patient as
    he devised a plan that would allow him to conquer the continent. It was necessary
    to wait until the young girl became a woman in order to create a new generation
    of Shapeshifters with superior powers. In the meantime, Cosette is trained in
    order to become more powerful, as well as nourished to enhance her genetic potential.
    Will she accept her destiny? After all, she had survived this whole time thanks
    to this man...
  summonDesc: "I w-w-w-won\u2019t disappoint you, m-m-m-master..."
  fusionDesc: My p-p-p-power... Is it t-t-that unique?
